1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Why did I never find out my
son was failing the year?

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Why didn't anyone tell me?

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
I did tell her.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Both are telling the truth.
And neither can prove it.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
It's not an isolated case.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
In a single school year, 31,000
students failed the year.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
And to prove she warned them,

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
the teacher needs a folder
full of paper reports.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
What about a chat? In Ecuador,
a teacher who shares her number

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
can end up threatened or extorted,
just for giving a fair grade.

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
No one should have to choose
between warning in time

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
and protecting their family.

13
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
That's why we built Cresco.

14
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
One: everything in writing, the same day.

15
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
The teacher records it; the family is
notified instantly, without naming the child.

16
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
And she sees who opened it.
Now the folder fills itself.

17
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Two: no one is anonymous.

18
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Families dispute under their own
name; the teacher answers in writing.

19
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Three: the teacher never
gives out her number.

20
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,000
To talk, families book a
meeting in her office hours.

21
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Cresco isn't another chat. It's the
record that today only exists on paper.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:31,000
What keeps people safe is always free.
Premium appears when a family wants more.

23
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The purchase goes through RevenueCat,

24
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
and its webhook tells our
server what to unlock.

25
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
More history, a PDF report, zero ads.

26
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:45,000
And teachers with several
classes get their own PRO plan.

27
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,000
I did tell her.

28
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
And I saw it.

29
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Built by students in Ecuador.

30
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Cresco: so no warning
sign arrives too late.
